v 3
d sparkta2: interactive D3 maps and charts from Stata
d
d sparkta2 creates interactive D3 maps and native charts from Stata, and
d forwards other chart types to sparkta when it is installed.
d
d Requires: Stata 17.0 or newer
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth, Senior Research Analyst, Texas 2036
d Distribution-Date: 20260725
